MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9af6d135f117f114abb17efab4b88716, type: 3}
  m_Name: EndSequence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarrativeSequence
  defaultSpeakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
  defaultNpcSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2c3aec1d7ff49bf4ea021d689a4fe10a, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speakerName: Quade v4.4 (Therapy AI Antagonist)
    text: This.... can't be.... You defeated me, Quade.
    npcSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b3cf86fe395de4c8c6dcf93dbea392, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Quade v4.4 (Therapy AI Antagonist)
    text: The "e" was silent, in case you were wondering. That spells "Quad." Boo!
    npcSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7d5a898ea2c3eb043a733bfd01cef5c5, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: You didn't even flinch -- and that not only shows bravery, but growth.
      Well, glad we could work out a solution to your little problem!
    npcSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d6e84005d39652948aa48fdd18318e0b, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: I'll send Doctor Greg a notice -- you passed your evaluation!
    npcSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ad6fb7622aa6b0c409c09eee9d2307cd, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: Those minigames I generated for you before are still here, should you ever
      need to face them again. Don't worry, I believe you're cured.
    npcSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f8105097818046345aa5a38f9263747e, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: Goodbye, my not-fearful-of-four friend!
    npcSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f8105097818046345aa5a38f9263747e, type: 3}
